---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-16 pt-20 text-center sm:pt-28">
  <Logo class="mx-auto h-16 w-auto sm:h-20" />

  <h1 class="mt-8 text-balance font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-chestnut sm:text-5xl">
    沙發上的性心理
  </h1>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-pretty font-serif text-lg leading-[1.8] text-chestnut/80 sm:text-xl">
    允許疑惑，接納渴望；<br class="hidden sm:block" />
    在這張沙發上，最重要的永遠是<span
      class="rounded bg-[var(--color-accent)]/35 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-medium text-chestnut"
      >尊重你自己的感受</span
    >。
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10">
    <a
      href="#articles"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-cream transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_0_0_8px_rgba(196,164,149,0.3)]"
    >
      <span aria-hidden="true">🛋️</span>
      選一張沙發坐下
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
